1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:03,800
(Amy:)Oh, I'm not
confused at all.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:07,000
(Amy:)You're like a sexy toddler.

3
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:10,840
(Sheldon:)I don't know
how to process that.

4
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,210
(Sheldon:)I do.

5
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:17,310
♪ Amy and Sheldon
sitting in a tree ♪

6
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:21,220
♪ K-I-S-S-S-S-I-N-G. ♪

7
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,320
(Penny:)That's too many S's
for "kissing."

8
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:27,630
(Bernadette:)Not if they're doing it
for a long time.

9
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:32,560
(Penny:)Sheldon... have you
ever kissed a girl?

10
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:36,280
(Sheldon:)Other than my mother,
my sister and my Mee-Maw, no.

11
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,040
(Sheldon:)But in the interest
of full disclosure,

12
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,870
(Sheldon:)I was once on a bus

13
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,970
(Sheldon:)and had to give
mouth-to-mouth resuscitation

14
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:45,580
(Sheldon:)to an elderly nun who passed out
from heat exhaustion.

15
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,600
(Sheldon:)Every year I get
a Christmas card from her,

16
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:52,150
(Sheldon:)signed with far
too many X's and O's.

17
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:54,020
(Bernadette:)That doesn't count.

18
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,190
(Bernadette:)Aren't you even
a little curious?

19
00:00:56,190 --> 00:01:00,060
(Penny:)Yeah, you're a scientist--
where is the curiosity?

